<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2062730658"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1697040466"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Φ²"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HOYO-MiX / TetraCalyx"/><amll:meta key="album" value="崩坏3-在海的指尖-Original Soundtrack"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:26.720"><div begin="01:44.180" end="02:26.720"><p begin="01:44.180" end="01:50.290" itunes:key="L1">Here I feel the touch brought by the real number solution<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感受到了实数解的触碰</span></p><p begin="01:50.290" end="01:55.150" itunes:key="L2">Ripples of two souls now have reached our double slits<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两个灵魂的涟漪已到达属于我们的那对狭缝</span></p><p begin="01:55.150" end="02:01.140" itunes:key="L3">Casting stripes of light and dark in the world as days and nights<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这世界投射出明暗条带 作为日夜更迭</span></p><p begin="02:01.140" end="02:03.940" itunes:key="L4">You set me free under the sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我在阳光下自由</span></p><p begin="02:03.940" end="02:08.540" itunes:key="L5">I fly your cradle dreams to the moon and back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我倾愿放飞你的襁褓之梦</span></p><p begin="02:08.540" end="02:11.640" itunes:key="L6">A worm will turn into a butterfly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虫会先化成蝶</span></p><p begin="02:11.640" end="02:14.880" itunes:key="L7">Before one can answer "who am I"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在一个人能找到自我之前</span></p><p begin="02:14.880" end="02:16.840" itunes:key="L8">After the ice turns into water<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在冰化成水之后</span></p><p begin="02:16.840" end="02:26.720" itunes:key="L9">The sea I hang upside down will be your sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我倒悬过来的海会成为你的天</span></p></div></body></tt>